  "text": "Enterprise LLM pipelines often choke on document parsing before generation even begins. PaperPilot changes that. With our native Rust ingestion gateway, documents like this quarterly financial report are parsed in just 3.4 milliseconds, taking under 50 megabytes of memory. Clean tabular Markdown feeds directly into high-throughput models like Llama 3.3 70B, instantly delivering accurate financial intelligence with zero cloud egress. Blazing speed, minimal footprint. Get started at usepaperpilot.com.",
